# efs project state (compact memory)

efs: distributed FS, 2+1 XOR EC, FUSE client, RDMA (RC QP), 128 KiB chunks.
Pre-alpha. **Goal: scale to >= 2^32 files/dirs** (see docs/scaling-roadmap.md).

